# Keep local Claude Code state out of the repo, but DO share project
# skills. Must be `.claude/*` rather than `.claude/`: git never descends
# into an excluded directory, so a `!` negation under `.claude/` would
# silently have no effect.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
*.swp
*.bak

